{"questionId":"u02-s015-v002","unitId":"u02","numericUnitId":2,"topicId":"u02-fraction-literacy","skillId":"fraction-literacy-context","difficulty":"basic","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"食品標示每份含糖 12 公克，一盒有 5又1/2 份。整盒含糖多少公克？","choices":["60 公克","66 公克","72 公克","78 公克"],"answerIndex":1,"explanation":"依題意逐步處理：5又1/2=5.5；12×5.5=66。所以答案是「66 公克」。","steps":["5又1/2=5.5","12×5.5=66"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"60 公克","truth":false,"reason":"只算5份。"},{"choice":"66 公克","truth":true,"reason":"66公克正確。"},{"choice":"72 公克","truth":false,"reason":"把半份算成1份。"},{"choice":"78 公克","truth":false,"reason":"12×5又1/2=66公克；78公克不符合每份12公克的乘法。"}],"commonMistake":"忽略半份或把份數取整。","concept":"每份量乘份數可含帶分數。","tags":["數與量","分數與百分率和週期的綜合情境應用","basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":"60","prerequisiteSkillIds":["fraction-base-quantity"],"authoringIntent":"讀取營養標示。","literacyContextNecessity":"每份含糖量與盒內份數共同決定整盒含糖量。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"03923693a86be02c28fa779c85a35d747ac8d9473043ea69a07949b2747e299e"}
{"questionId":"u02-s015-v003","unitId":"u02","numericUnitId":2,"topicId":"u02-fraction-literacy","skillId":"fraction-literacy-context","difficulty":"basic","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"活動每 12 天一次，今天舉行後，第 60 天是否會再舉行？","choices":["不會，因60不是12的因數","不會，因60小於12²","會，因60是12的倍數","資訊不足"],"answerIndex":2,"explanation":"依題意逐步處理：60÷12=5；第60天是第5個週期，會舉行。所以答案是「會，因60是12的倍數」。","steps":["60÷12=5","第60天是第5個週期，會舉行"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"不會，因60不是12的因數","truth":false,"reason":"因數方向讀反。"},{"choice":"不會，因60小於12²","truth":false,"reason":"12²與週期無關。"},{"choice":"會，因60是12的倍數","truth":true,"reason":"60是12的倍數。"},{"choice":"資訊不足","truth":false,"reason":"資料足夠。"}],"commonMistake":"把週期判斷看成因數而非倍數。","concept":"事件日是週期的倍數。","tags":["數與量","分數與百分率和週期的綜合情境應用","basic"],"estimatedTimeSec":"60","prerequisiteSkillIds":["fraction-base-quantity"],"authoringIntent":"用倍數判斷週期日。","literacyContextNecessity":"週期12天與指定第60天共同決定是否落在活動時點。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"a02d35cfeff55ead15da41798be4e54cf5dc6371170fd7d2bfd76734bd6d17c8"}
{"questionId":"u02-s015-v004","unitId":"u02","numericUnitId":2,"topicId":"u02-fraction-literacy","skillId":"fraction-literacy-context","difficulty":"standard","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"一批貨物先出貨全數的 2/5，再出貨剩餘的 1/3。最後剩原數的多少？","choices":["2/15","3/5","7/15","2/5"],"answerIndex":3,"explanation":"依題意逐步處理：第一次後剩3/5；第二次出剩餘1/3，所以保留2/3；最後3/5×2/3=2/5。所以答案是「2/5」。","steps":["第一次後剩3/5","第二次出剩餘1/3，所以保留2/3；最後3/5×2/3=2/5"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"2/15","truth":false,"reason":"這是第二次出貨佔原量。"},{"choice":"3/5","truth":false,"reason":"只算第一次剩餘。"},{"choice":"7/15","truth":false,"reason":"把兩次出貨比例直接相加。"},{"choice":"2/5","truth":true,"reason":"最後剩2/5。"}],"commonMistake":"把『剩餘的1/3』誤成原數的1/3。","concept":"連續比例的基準會改變，要乘保留倍率。","tags":["數與量","分數與百分率和週期的綜合情境應用","standard"],"estimatedTimeSec":"60","prerequisiteSkillIds":["fraction-base-quantity"],"authoringIntent":"處理變動基準的分率。","literacyContextNecessity":"第二次比例明確以剩餘量為基準，不能與第一次直接相加。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"745af8951a2c228443fce42ce0c3bee5e53fa7adbb12e0ff6f94fda41df96b57"}
{"questionId":"u02-s015-v005","unitId":"u02","numericUnitId":2,"topicId":"u02-fraction-literacy","skillId":"fraction-literacy-context","difficulty":"standard","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"店家進貨 240 件，第一週售出 35%，第二週售出原進貨量的 1/4。尚餘多少件？","choices":["96 件","84 件","120 件","156 件"],"answerIndex":0,"explanation":"依題意逐步處理：第一週售84件，第二週售60件；剩240-84-60=96。所以答案是「96 件」。","steps":["第一週售84件，第二週售60件","剩240-84-60=96"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"96 件","truth":true,"reason":"96件正確。"},{"choice":"84 件","truth":false,"reason":"把1/4作用在剩餘量。"},{"choice":"120 件","truth":false,"reason":"只扣一週。"},{"choice":"156 件","truth":false,"reason":"這是售出總數。"}],"commonMistake":"未看清第二週比例以原進貨量為基準。","concept":"同題不同百分率可能使用同一或不同基準，須讀文字。","tags":["數與量","分數與百分率和週期的綜合情境應用","standard"],"estimatedTimeSec":"60","prerequisiteSkillIds":["fraction-base-quantity"],"authoringIntent":"混合百分率與分數。","literacyContextNecessity":"進貨量、第一週百分率和第二週以原量為基準的分率共同決定剩餘庫存。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"812a695ea9f63125d42986c9847c0148ebb11bc2244bfbb3f9e282f4ee612ac6"}
