{"questionId":"u02-s015-v007","unitId":"u02","numericUnitId":2,"topicId":"u02-fraction-literacy","skillId":"fraction-literacy-context","difficulty":"advanced","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"某班男生佔全班的 5/12，女生比男生多 8 人。全班有多少人？","choices":["36 人","42 人","48 人","60 人"],"answerIndex":2,"explanation":"依題意逐步處理：女生佔7/12，男女差2/12=1/6全班；1/6全班=8，所以全班48。所以答案是「48 人」。","steps":["女生佔7/12，男女差2/12=1/6全班","1/6全班=8，所以全班48"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"36 人","truth":false,"reason":"全班36人時男女差為36×(2/12)=6人，不符合相差8人。"},{"choice":"42 人","truth":false,"reason":"1/6×42=7。"},{"choice":"48 人","truth":true,"reason":"48人正確。"},{"choice":"60 人","truth":false,"reason":"差10人。"}],"commonMistake":"直接把8人除以5/12。","concept":"差額對應兩比例之差。","tags":["數與量","分數與百分率和週期的綜合情境應用","advanced"],"estimatedTimeSec":"60","prerequisiteSkillIds":["fraction-base-quantity"],"authoringIntent":"由部分比例差反求總量。","literacyContextNecessity":"男女比例互補且人數差8，兩者共同建立1/6全班=8。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"d45de7fade69e25c67cfdc723c3cf60b05950fbfc20bd347c626bdbd5125c9be"}
{"questionId":"u02-s015-v008","unitId":"u02","numericUnitId":2,"topicId":"u02-fraction-literacy","skillId":"fraction-literacy-context","difficulty":"advanced","type":"mc","visualMode":"text-only","figureId":null,"sourceScope":"CAP_108_JUNIOR_MATH","text":"商品原價未知，先打八折再加 5% 稅，實付 1680 元。原價是多少？","choices":["1900 元","1950 元","2100 元","2000 元"],"answerIndex":3,"explanation":"依題意逐步處理：總倍率0.8×1.05=0.84；原價=1680÷0.84=2000。所以答案是「2000 元」。","steps":["總倍率0.8×1.05=0.84","原價=1680÷0.84=2000"],"optionAnalysis":[{"choice":"1900 元","truth":false,"reason":"1900×0.84=1596。"},{"choice":"1950 元","truth":false,"reason":"1950×0.84=1638。"},{"choice":"2100 元","truth":false,"reason":"2100×0.84=1764。"},{"choice":"2000 元","truth":true,"reason":"2000×0.84=1680。"}],"commonMistake":"把折扣與稅率直接相減成75%。","concept":"連續價格變化用倍率相乘，再反除。","tags":["數與量","分數與百分率和週期的綜合情境應用","advanced"],"estimatedTimeSec":"60","prerequisiteSkillIds":["fraction-base-quantity"],"authoringIntent":"折扣加稅反求原價。","literacyContextNecessity":"折扣、稅率與實付金額共同決定原價，計算順序不可交換為百分點加減。","reviewStatus":"independently-reviewed","noTemplateDeclaration":true,"contentSha256":"e7fb59babc716043f2a3468f890d7cade3f51234e2b79cde3c125e3e3926ac4b"}
